     array and then forgotten. Four or more words pasted in wipes the field
     without checking anything.

     The wordlist below is bip-0039/english.txt from the bitcoin/bips
     repository, inlined verbatim in list order.

     SELF-TEST VECTORS (all checked on load; results are refused if any fail):
       V1  length is 2048
       V2  first word "abandon", last word "zoo"
       V3  sorted ascending, every entry lowercase a-z, 3 to 8 letters
       V4  first four letters unique across all 2048 words
       V5  known indices: abandon 0, ability 1, about 3, acid 15, legal 1019,
